usage: xdpgate-ctl open  <ip> <tcp|udp> <port> [timeout_secs]
       xdpgate-ctl close <ip> <tcp|udp> <port>
       xdpgate-ctl add-protected <ip>      (transient - see reload)
       xdpgate-ctl del-protected <ip>      (transient - see reload)
       xdpgate-ctl reload                  apply /srv/xdpgate/gate.conf
       xdpgate-ctl export                  dump the live set as config
       xdpgate-ctl list
       xdpgate-ctl gc
